Description: General Ludd Agent — autonomous coding system with ansible runners
 A multi-model autonomous coding agent with ansible runners, daemon,
 CLI, TUI, event loop, and agent management. Includes support for
 CI pipelines, security scanning, test execution, and infrastructure
 as code.
